mCharts_Yearly_Rank_3\":\"Bronze\",\"SteamCharts_Yearly_Rank_3_subtitle\":\"51st - 100th sorted randomly\",\"SteamCharts_Yearly_Unavailable\":\"Page not Available\",\"SteamCharts_Yearly_BannerDesc\":\"A look back at the year\\'s top sellers, best new releases, most played games, and more!\",\"SteamCharts_Yearly_FAQ\":\"Curious how we determine the best of year?\",\"SteamCharts_Yearly_FAQ_link\":\"Click here to find out\",\"SteamCharts_MostPlayedDeck_Title\":\"Steam Deck Top Played\",\"SteamCharts_MostPlayedDeck_Subtitle\":\"Top 100 played games on Steam Deck in the \",\"SteamCharts_MostPlayedDeck_Option_PastWeek\":\"past week\",\"SteamCharts_MostPlayedDeck_Option_PastMonth\":\"past month\",\"SteamCharts_MostPlayedDeck_Option_PastYear\":\"past year\",\"SteamCharts_MostPlayedDeck_TableDeckVerified\":\"Verified\",\"SteamCharts_MostPlayedDeck_TableDeckVerified_Tooltip\":\"Steam Deck compatibility rating.\",\"SteamCharts_MostPlayedDeck_TableChangeWeek_Tooltip\":\"Change in rank compared to previous week.\",\"SteamCharts_MostPlayedDeck_TableChangeMonth_Tooltip\":\"Change in rank compared to previous month.\",\"SteamCharts_MostPlayedDeck_TableChangeYear_Tooltip\":\"Change in rank compared to previous year.\",\"SteamCharts_Graph_PeakConcurrent\":\"PEAK ONLINE\",\"SteamCharts_Graph_PeakConcurrent_ttip\":\"Peak number of players online in the past 72 hours\",\"SteamCharts_Graph_OnlineNow\":\"ONLINE NOW\",\"SteamCharts_OverviewGraph_Title_TopSellers\":\"TOP SELLING GAMES\",\"SteamCharts_OverviewGraph_Title_MostPlayed\":\"MOST PLAYED\",\"SteamCharts_OverviewGraph_Title_PlayersOnline\":\"PLAYERS ONLINE\",\"SteamCharts_OverviewGraph_Tooltip_OnlineAt\":\"%1$s online at %2$s\",\"SteamCharts_OverviewGraph_Title_Live\":\"LIVE\",\"SteamCharts_OverviewGraph_Title_Games\":\"GAMES\",\"SteamCharts_OverviewGraph_Button_TopSelling\":\"SEE ALL 100 TOP SELLERS\",\"SteamCharts_OverviewGraph_Button_MostPlayed\":\"SEE ALL 100 MOST PLAYED\",\"SteamCharts_OverviewGraph_Desc_TopSelling\":\"TOP SELLING RIGHT NOW\",\"SteamCharts_OverviewGraph_Desc_MostPlayed\":\"MOST PLAYED RIGHT NOW\",\"SteamCharts_OverviewGraph_Desc_InGame\":\"IN GAME\",\"SteamCharts_Overview_Title_Weekly\":\"WEEKLY\",\"SteamCharts_Overview_Title_Monthly\":\"MONTHLY\",\"SteamCharts_Overview_Title_Yearly\":\"YEARLY\",\"SteamCharts_Overview_Title_MonthlyTop\":\"TOP NEW RELEASES\",\"SteamCharts_Overview_Title_BestOf_WithYear\":\"%1$s The Best Of\",\"SteamCharts_Overview_Title_More\":\"MORE STATS\",\"SteamCharts_Overview_Link_Hardware\":\"Steam Hardware & Software Survey\",\"SteamCharts_Overview_Link_Download\":\"Steam Download Stats\",\"SteamCharts_Overview_Link_Support\":\"Steam Customer Support Stats\",\"SteamCharts_PageTitle_Overview\":\"CHARTS OVERVIEW\",\"SteamCharts_PageSubTitle_Overview\":\"Top selling and top played games across Steam\",\"SteamCharts_UnknownGameTitle\":\"Unavailable Game\",\"SteamCharts_UnavailableCountryRestriction\":\"(not available in your region)\",\"SteamCharts_BlockedByPreferences\":\"(hidden by your preferences)\",\"SteamCharts_NewMonth_TrailersTitle\":\"Browse Recommeded Trailers\",\"SteamCharts_NewMonth_NoRelease\":\"No new games released on Steam this month\",\"SteamCharts_SupportStats\":\"Support Stats\",\"SupportStats_Header_Title_Updated\":\"Updated: %1$s\",\"SupportStats_Header_Desc\":\"Our on-going goal with Steam is to improve the experience of our users in all areas, including customer support.  We believe that by sharing this data, we\\'ll be able to spot problems earlier, identify areas for improvement, and to ultimately create better customer support experiences.  <1>Read more about why we created this page on our Steam blog.</1>\",\"SupportStats_RequestsAndBacklog_Title\":\"Help Requests and Backlog\",\"SuportStats_MostRecent90Days\":\"(most recent 90 days)\",\"SupportStats_RecentSupportActivity_Title\":\"Recent Help Request Activity\",\"SupportStats_TicketsByCategory\":\"Request Category\",\"SupportStats_TicketsLast24Hours\":\"Submitted Last 24 Hours\",\"SupportStats_TimeToResponse\":\"Typical Response Times\",\"SupportStats_RecentWaitTimeData\":\"%1$s to %2$s\",\"SteamDeck_Menu_Store\":\"Store Home\",\"SteamDeck_Menu_Categories\":\"Categories\",\"SteamDeck_Menu_Search\":\"Search\",\"SteamDeck_Menu_Wishlist_Empty\":\"Wishlist\",\"SteamDeck_Menu_Wishlist\":\"Wishlist (%1$s)\",\"SteamDeck_Menu_Wallet_Empty\":\"Wallet\",\"SteamDeck_Menu_Wallet\":\"Wallet (%1$s)\",\"SteamDeck_Menu_Cart\":\"Cart %1$s\",\"NotificationSettings_Title\":\"Steam Notifications\",\"NotificationSettings_Desc1\":\"Steam will display a summary of notifications on startup, then reduce the frequency to only notify you when necessary.\",\"NotificationSettings_Desc2\":\"Note: Turning off a notification type also means it will not show up in the green bell at the top of the Steam Client.\",\"NotificationSettings_SendMeWhen\":\"Send me a notification when...\",\"NotificationSettings_Email_Title\":\"Email Notifications\",\"NotificationSettings_Email_Button\":\"Manage Email Notifications\",\"CookiePref_OptionalCookies_Title\":\"Optional Cookies\",\"CookiePref_TechnicallyNeccesary_Title\":\"Technically Necessary Cookies\",\"CookiePref_TechnicallyNeccesary_Desc\":\"The following cookies are always set when you use the Steam websites\",\"CookiePref_SessionID_Title\":\"sessionid\",\"CookiePref_SessionID_Desc\":\"Protects our users and services against certain attacks (so-called cross-site request forgery / CSRF attacks).\",\"CookiePref_AcceptAll\":\"Accept All\",\"CookiePref_RejectAll\":\"Reject All\",\"CookiePref_ShoppingCart_Title\":\"shoppingCartGID\",\"CookiePref_ShoppingCart_Desc\":\"Set only if you’ve added items to your shopping cart on the Steam store while not logged in.\",\"CookiePref_SteamCountry_Title\":\"steamCountry\",\"CookiePref_SteamCountry_Desc\":\"Cached result of doing an iploc lookup on your public ip address. This is used to comply with regional legal and taxation requirements.\",\"CookiePref_Timezone_Title\":\"timezoneOffset\",\"CookiePref_Timezone_Desc\":\"Your system timezone setting, which is set in a cookie so that the server can display times appropriately.\",\"CookiePref_BirthTime_Title\":\"birthtime and lastagecheckage:\",\"CookiePref_BirthTime_Desc\":\"This is only set if you fill out an age gate and is used to limit access to potentially inappropriate content.\",\"CookiePref_CookieSettings_Title\":\"cookieSettings\",\"CookiePref_CookieSettings_Desc\":\"This stores the settings you make on this page or on the cookie warning banner.\",\"CookiePref_Login_Title\":\"steamLoginSecure, steamRememberLogin, and steamMachineAuth\",\"CookiePref_Login_Desc\":\"These are used to support secure login to Steam.\",\"CookiePref_Language_Title\":\"Steam_Language\",\"CookiePref_Language_Desc\":\"We cache your preferred language so it will be used the next time you visit Steam.\",\"CookiePref_Content_Title\":\"Valve\\'s Content Customization Cookies\",\"CookiePref_Content_Desc\":\"To customize the editorial content on Steam based on your use of services\",\"CookiePref_Content_ToggleTitle\":\"recentapps\",\"CookiePref_Content_ToggleDesc\":\"Game pages you\\'ve visited (sometimes displays in the store footer in place of recommendations)\",\"CookiePref_ValveAnalytics_Title\":\"Valve\\'s Analytics Cookies\",\"CookiePref_ValveAnalytics_Desc\":\"To measure the audience on Steam and improve services\",\"CookiePref_ValveAnalytics_ToggleTitle\":\"app_impressions and browserid\",\"CookiePref_ValveAnalytics_ToggleDesc\":\"Our own internal analytics that we use to determine traffic to a specific store page and reported anonymously. App_impressions lasts only for one page view.\",\"CookiePref_ThirdParty_Title\":\"Third Party Media Sharing Cookies\",\"CookiePref_ThirdParty_Desc\":\"These are necessary to embed certain external media in our websites\",\"CookiePref_YouTube_Title\":\"YouTube\",\"CookiePref_YouTube_Desc\":\"Cookies placed by embedded YouTube players within Steam.  Subject to %1$s\",\"CookiePref_YouTube_TogglePolicyName\":\"Google’s Privacy Policy\",\"CookiePref_Vimeo_Title\":\"Vimeo\",\"CookiePref_Vimeo_Desc\":\"Cookies placed by embedded Vimeo players within Steam. Subject to %1$s\",\"CookiePref_Vimeo_TogglePolicyName\":\"Vimeo\\'s Privacy Policy\",\"CookiePref_Sketchfab_Title\":\"Sketchfab\",\"CookiePref_Sketchfab_Desc\":\"Cookies placed by embedded Sketchfab players within Steam.  Subject to %1$s\",\"CookiePref_Sketchfab_TogglePolicyName\":\"Sketchfab\\'s Privacy Policy\",\"CookiePref_Error\":\"Error\",\"CookiePref_ErrorNotSaved\":\"Your preferences have not been saved. Please try again later.\",\"DataCollectionPref_Error\":\"Error\",\"DataCollectionPref_ErrorNotSaved\":\"Your preferences have not been saved. Please try again later.\",\"DataPreferences_Header\":\"Data Collection\",\"DataPreferences_Provide_SteamOS_Feedback_Title\":\"Ask Me For Feedback\",\"DataPreferences_Provide_SteamOS_Feedback_Desc\":\"You can help us improve Steam OS by allowing Steam to ask an occasional question about your experience.  For example while in the Steam Library you may see a prompt asking if the Steam Deck Compatibility rating for a game is accurate.\",\"DataPreferences_Provide_SteamOS_Feedback_Label\":\"Steam can ask me for feedback while using Steam OS devices\",\"DataPreferences_FrameRateReporting_Title\":\"Anonymous Game Framerate Data\",\"DataPreferences_FrameRateReporting_Description\":\"This data helps us learn about game compatibility and improve the experience on devices running Steam.  Data is stored anonymously without a connection to your Steam account, and identified with the kind of hardware you are playing on.\",\"DataPreferences_FrameRateReporting_Label\":\"Enable anonymous framerate collection while playing games and logged in with this Steam account\",\"SavedHardware_Title\":\"Saved Hardware\",\"SavedHardware_Desc\":\"These are devices you\\'ve chosen to save to your account in order to share your device specifications with Steam reviews.\",\"SavedHardware_AddNew\":\"+ Add This PC\",\"SavedHardware_Delete\":\"Delete\",\"SavedHardware_Rename\":\"Rename\",\"SavedHardware_Rename_Confirm_Title\":\"Rename This Hardware\",\"SavedHardware_Rename_Confirm_Label\":\"New Name:\",\"SavedHardware_Delete_Confirm_Title\":\"Delete This Hardware?\",\"SavedHardware_Delete_Confirm_Desc\":\"Are you sure you want to delete \\'%1$s\\'? This cannot be undone. This will also remove the association between this hardware and any relevant reviews.\",\"SavedHardware_Error_Title\":\"Error\",\"SavedHardware_Error_Desc\":\"There was a problem trying to save your changes. Please try again later.\",\"SavedHardware_Timestamp\":\"Saved %1$s\",\"NotificationPref_Error\":\"Error\",\"NotificationPref_ErrorNotSaved\":\"Your preferences have not been saved. The Steam servers are busy. Please try again later.\",\"PrivacySettings_Marketing_Header\":\"Browsing\",\"PrivacySettings_Marketing_Title\":\"Third Party Links (UTM)\",\"PrivacySettings_Marketing_Desc\":\"Some game developers add additional information to their Steam Store page web links using a format called UTM.  The UTM information is used to measure the effectiveness of web sites, customer communications and marketing campaigns. Steam summarizes and anonymizes the data to protect user privacy, then provides the developer with a report on how these UTM links performed.\",\"PrivacySettings_UTM_ToggleLabel\":\"UTM\",\"PrivacySettings_UTM_ToggleDesc\":\"Include how my UTM visits performed in the summarized, anonymized reports provided to game developers\",\"accountpreferences_authorized_devices_header\":\"Authorized Devices\",\"accountpreferences_authorized_devices_description\":\"This section lists the PCs, mobile devices, and web browsers where your account has recently been signed in.%1$sTo end all current sessions and sign you out of all devices and browsers, select \\\\\"Sign out everywhere\\\\\" below.\",\"accountpreferences_revoked_devices_revoked_header\":\"Signed Out Devices\",\"accountpreferences_revoked_devices_revoked_description\":\"Your account isn\\'t usable on these devices unless you sign in with your password.\",\"accountpreferences_revoked_devices_revoked_description_email\":\"Your account isn\\'t usable on these devices unless you sign in with your password and a Steam Guard code from email.\",\"accountpreferences_revoked_devices_revoked_description_auth\":\"Your account isn\\'t usable on these devices unless you sign in with your password and a mobile confirmation.\",\"accountpreferences_authorized_devices_steam_support\":\"Steam Support\",\"accountpreferences_authorized_devices_recommendations\":\"Recommendations\",\"accountpreferences_authorized_devices_remove_button\":\"Sign out everywhere\",\"accountpreferences_authorized_devices_remove_header\":\"Sign out of all devices\",\"accountpreferences_authorized_devices_remove_desc\":\"This option will end all current sessions and sign you out of all devices and browsers. To use Steam you\\'ll need to re-enter your account name, password, and Steam Guard.\",\"accountpreferences_authorized_devices_remove_failed_message_generic\":\"An unexpected error occurred while removing expired devices. Please try again.\",\"accountpreferences_authorized_devices_remove_failed_message_code\":\"An error occurred (%1$d) while removing devices.\",\"accountpreferences_authorized_devices_none\":\"No devices to show.\",\"accountpreferences_authorized_devices_type_header\":\"Device type\",\"accountpreferences_authorized_devices_description_header\":\"Device name (if any)\",\"accountpreferences_authorized_devices_firstauthorized_header\":\"First authorized\",\"accountpreferences_authorized_devices_state_header\":\"State\",\"accountpreferences_authorized_devices_table\":\"Authorized devices\",\"accountpreferences_authorized_devices_loggedout_table\":\"Signed-out devices\",\"accountpreferences_authorized_devices_loggedoutdate_header\":\"Date signed out\",\"accountpreferences_authorized_devices_generic\":\"Device\",\"accountpreferences_devices_none\":\"You have no current devices of this type.\",\"accountpreferences_devices_none_2\":\"You have no authorized devices.\",\"accountpreferences_authorized_devices_modal_title\":\"Remove all devices\",\"accountpreferences_authorized_devices_modal_text\":\"Are you sure? This revokes the authorization for all listed devices. You will need to log in to Steam again.\",\"accountpreferences_authorized_devices_type_client\":\"Steam Client\",\"accountpreferences_authorized_devices_type_browser\":\"Web browser\",\"accountpreferences_authorized_devices_type_mobile\":\"Mobile device\",\"accountpreferences_authorized_devices_type_steamdeck\":\"Steam Deck\",\"accountpreferences_authorized_devices_type_steamos\":\"SteamOS device\",\"accountpreferences_authorized_devices_type_legiongos\":\"Legion Go S\",\"accountpreferences_authorized_devices_type_desktop\":\"PC Steam Client\",\"accountpreferences_authorized_devices_type_unknown\":\"Unknown Client\",\"accountpreferences_authorized_devices_state_current\":\"Current\",\"accountpreferences_authorized_devices_state_signedout\":\"Signed out\",\"accountpreferences_authorized_devices_recent_heading\":\"Signed In and Recently Online\",\"accountpreferences_authorized_devices_loc_unknown\":\"\",\"accountpreferences_authorized_devices_last_seen_title\":\"Last active: \",\"accountpreferences_authorized_devices_last_seen_max\":\"more than 90 days ago\",\"accountpreferences_authorized_devices_other_heading\":\"Other Signed In Devices\",\"accountpreferences_authorized_devices_recentseen_heading\":\"Recently seen devices\",\"accountpreferences_authorized_device_active_now\":\"Active now\",\"accountpreferences_authorized_devices_was_not_me\":\"This wasn\\'t me\",\"accountpreferences_authorized_devices_this_device\":\"This Device\",\"accountpreferences_authorized_devices_new_device\":\"New Device (first seen less than 2 weeks ago) <1>Not you</1>?\",\"accountpreferences_authorized_devices_suspicous_tooltip\":\"This session is in a different country. Make sure this is you.\",\"accountpreferences_authorized_devices_browser_on_os\":\"%1$s on %2$s\",\"accountpreferences_authorized_devices_browser_unmatched\":\"Unknown web browser\",\"accountpreferences_authorized_devices_name_separator\":\"-\",\"authorized_devices_deauthorize_title\":\"Deauthorize all devices?\",\"authorized_devices_deauthorize_msg\":\"This will log you out of Steam everywhere, including this session. You will need to reauthorize each device, computer, and browser you wish to use.\",\"authorized_devices_deauthorize_proceed\":\"Proceed\",\"authorized_devices_default_password\":\"You authorized this device on %1$s with your password.\",\"authorized_devices_default_qr\":\"You authorized this device on %1$s from your Steam Guard Mobile Authenticator.\",\"authorized_devices_emailcode_password\":\"You authorized this device on %1$s with your password and a Steam Guard code from your email.\",\"authorized_devices_devicecode_password\":\"You authorized this device on %1$s with your password and a code from your Steam Guard Mobile Authenticator.\",\"authorized_devices_mobileconf_password\":\"You authorized this device on %1$s with your password. You approved the login on your Steam Guard Mobile Authenticator.\",\"authorized_devices_machinetoken_password\":\"You authorized this device on %1$s with your password.\",\"authorized_devices_remembered_machine\":\"This device is not currently signed in, but is remembered. If you sign in on this device, you will only need to use your password. You will not need to use a Steam Guard code or confirmation.\",\"authorized_devices_lasttwofactor_login\":\"Approved a login %1$s\",\"authorized_devices_lasttwofactor_confirmation_unknown_allow\":\"Approved a mobile confirmation %1$s\",\"authorized_devices_lasttwofactor_confirmation_unknown_cancel\":\"Cancelled a mobile confirmation %1$s\",\"authorized_devices_lasttwofactor_confirmation_trade_allow\":\"Approved a trade %1$s\",\"authorized_devices_lasttwofactor_confirmation_trade_cancel\":\"Cancelled a trade %1$s\",\"authorized_devices_lasttwofactor_confirmation_marketlisting_allow\":\"Approved a market listing %1$s\",\"authorized_devices_lasttwofactor_confirmation_marketlisting_cancel\":\"Cancelled a market listing %1$s\",\"authorized_devices_lasttwofactor_confirmation_phonechange_allow\":\"Approved a phone number change %1$s\",\"authorized_devices_lasttwofactor_confirmation_phonechange_cancel\":\"Cancelled a phone number change %1$s\",\"authorized_devices_lasttwofactor_confirmation_accountrecovery_allow\":\"Approved account recovery %1$s\",\"authorized_devices_lasttwofactor_confirmation_accountrecovery_cancel\":\"Cancelled account recovery %1$s\",\"authorized_devices_lasttwofactor_confirmation_buildchange_allow\":\"Approved a Steamworks build change %1$s\",\"authorized_devices_lasttwofactor_confirmation_buildchange_cancel\":\"Cancelled a Steamworks build change %1$s\",\"authorized_devices_lasttwofactor_confirmation_adduser_allow\":\"Approved adding a Steamworks user %1$s\",\"authorized_devices_lasttwofactor_confirmation_adduser_cancel\":\"Cancelled adding a Steamworks user %1$s\",\"authorized_devices_lasttwofactor_confirmation_registerapikey_allow\":\"Approved a new API key %1$s\",\"authorized_devices_lasttwofactor_confirmation_registerapikey_cancel\":\"Declined a new API key %1$s\",\"authorized_devices_lasttwofactor_confirmation_familygroupinvite_allow\":\"Confirmed sending a Steam Family invite %1$s\",\"authorized_devices_lasttwofactor_confirmation_familygroupinvite_cancel\":\"Declined sending a Steam Family invite %1$s\",\"authorized_devices_lasttwofactor_confirmation_joinfamilygroup_allow\":\"Confirmed a Steam Family invite %1$s\",\"authorized_devices_lasttwofactor_confirmation_joinfamilygroup_cancel\":\"Declined a Steam Family invite %1$s\",\"authorized_devices_lasttwofactor_confirmation_marketpurchase_allow\":\"Approved a market purchase %1$s\",\"authorized_devices_lasttwofactor_confirmation_marketpurchase_cancel\":\"Cancelled a market purchase %1$s\",\"authorized_devices_lasttwofactor_confirmation_refund_allow\":\"Approved a refund request %1$s\",\"authorized_devices_lasttwofactor_confirmation_refund_cancel\":\"Cancelled a refund request %1$s\",\"youraccount_account_security\":\"Account Security\",\"accountpreferences_account_security_description\":\"Steam Guard helps protect the value in your account from unauthorized access. You\\'ll be asked to verify your sign in with the Steam Mobile App. <1>Steam Guard FAQ</1>\",\"accountpreferences_account_security_account_name\":\"Steam account:\",\"accountpreferences_account_security_change_pass\":\"Change password\",\"accountpreferences_account_security_backup_codes\":\"Backup codes are single-use Steam Guard codes just for your account.\",\"accountpreferences_account_security_get_backup_codes\":\"Get backup codes\",\"accountpreferences_account_security_phone\":\"Phone number:\",\"accountpreferences_account_security_phone_hint\":\"Ends in **%1$s\",\"accountpreferences_account_security_phone_none\":\"None\",\"accountpreferences_account_security_manage_phone\":\"Manage phone number\",\"accountpreferences_account_security_email\":\"Email address:\",\"accountpreferences_account_security_email_status\":\"Status:\",\"accountpreferences_account_security_change_email\":\"Change email address\",\"youraccount_email_verified\":\"Verified\",\"youraccount_email_unverified\":\"Unverified\",\"accountpreferences_account_security_view_faq\":\"View FAQ\",\"accountpreferences_account_security_move\":\"Move authenticator to a new device\",\"accountpreferences_account_security_help_lost\":\"Help, I lost my authenticator\",\"accountpreferences_account_security_steamguard_remove\":\"Remove\",\"accountpreferences_account_security_verification\":\"Sign in verification:\",\"accountpreferences_account_security_via_email\":\"Via email\",\"accountpreferences_account_security_remove_email_guard\":\"Remove security\",\"accountpreferences_account_security_steamguard\":\"Steam Guard Mobile Authenticator\",\"accountpreferences_account_security_no_steamguard\":\"No mobile authenticator\",\"accountpreferences_account_security_get_app\":\"Get the <1>Steam Mobile App</1> with authenticator\",\"accountpreferences_account_security_scan_qr\":\"Scan this QR code with your phone to learn more about all of the mobile apps for Steam.\",\"accountpreferences_account_security_mobile_os_reqs\":\"Minimum OS required: iOS 15.1 or Android 7.0\",\"accountpreferences_account_security_apk_download\":\"Android users without access to Google Play can <1>download the latest version here</1>.\",\"accountpreferences_account_security_mobile_faq\":\"Steam Guard Mobile Authenticator FAQ\",\"DeckTopPlayedAppBanner_Title\":\"Steam Deck Top Played\",\"DeckTopPlayedAppBanner_Header\":\"Take this game anywhere!\",\"DeckTopPlayedAppBanner_GameText\":\"%1$s is one of the top played games on Steam Deck!\",\"DeckTopPlayedAppBanner_Header_LongTest\":\"Take this game anywhere! Extra for a long language!\",\"DeckTopPlayedAppBanner_GameText_LongTest\":\"%1$s is one of the top 100 games played on Steam Deck! Extra for a super long language!\",\"MarketingMessages_NoneAvailable\":\"There are no news items to show at this time.\",\"MarketingMessages_DLC_desc\":\"Get more from your game with these expansions and content packs\",\"MarketingMessages_DLC_desc_singular\":\"Get more from your game with new DLC\",\"MarketingMessages_DLC_lastplayed\":\"last played\",\"MarketingMessages_DLC_hours\":\"hours on record\",\"MarketingMessages_See_All_Items\":\"See all items\",\"MarketingMessages_See_Count_Items\":\"See DLC Page\",\"MarketingMessages_See_Count_Items_Plural\":\"See all %1$s items\",\"MarketingMessages_MajorUpdate\":\"Major Update\",\"DiscoveryQueue_ResumeWizard\":\"Resume Discovery Queue\",\"FacetedBrowsing_ViewAsList\":\"View As List\",\"FacetedBrowsing_ViewAsGrid\":\"View As Grid\",\"SeasonPass_Header\":\"Contents\",\"SeasonPass_Available\":\"Now Available\",\"SeasonPass_ShowStore\":\"See DLC Store Page\",\"SeasonPass_ReadEvent\":\"Read The Announcement\",\"SeasonPass_Incomplete_Desc\":\"This is a pack of content that is released over a period of time.\",\"SeasonPass_Incomplete_Desc2\":\"Steam will notify you when each item of content is released. You can <1>configure your notification preferences</1> at any time.\",\"SeasonPass_Status\":\"Status:\",\"SeasonPass_DLC_Status\":\"This content was released as DLC\",\"SeasonPass_Event_Status\":\"This content was added to game\",\"SeasonPass_Released_Date\":\"Released on:%1$s%2$s\",\"SeasonPass_Release_Date\":\"Coming:%1$s%2$s\",\"OpenInDesktopAppBanner_OpenAppButton\":\"Open in Desktop App\",\"OpenInDesktopAppBanner_NotSignedIn\":\"You\\'re not signed in!\",\"OpenInDesktopAppBanner_Body\":\"Open this page in the Steam App to wishlist, follow, purchase and see recommendations\",\"FamilyManagement_Title\":\"Family Management\",\"FamilyManagement_ManageTab\":\"Manage\",\"FamilyManagement_LibraryTab\":\"Library\",\"FamilyManagement_HistoryTab\":\"History\",\"FamilyManagement_PlaytimeTab\":\"Playtime\",\"FamilyManagement_RequestsTab\":\"Requests\",\"FamilyManagement_SetupTab\":\"Setup\",\"FamilyManagement_CreateInstructions\":\"Steam Families allow you to share your Steam games with up to 5 other household members, and manage parental controls for children in the family.\",\"FamilyManagement_CreateInstructions_2\":\"Family members can join a Steam Family as either an Adult or a Child. Adult members have family management permissions and can set parental controls for Child members. Parental controls include playtime limits, restricting access to specific Steam features, and limiting access to specific games.\",\"FamilyManagement_CreateInstructions_3\":\"Adults can administer the accounts of child members, including limiting their playtime, their access to features of Steam like Store and Community, and restricting the games they can access from other family members.\",\"FamilyManagement_CooldownNotice\":\"You can create or join a new Steam Family on %1$s.\",\"FamilyManagement_CanRejoin\":\"You can rejoin your last Steam Family if invited.\",\"FamilyManagement_CanUndelete\":\"You can restore the last Steam Family you were part of:\",\"FamilyManagement_SelectCreateButton\":\"Create a family\",\"FamilyManagement_SelectJoinButton\":\"Join a family\",\"FamilyManagement_SelectJoinButtonPendingInvite\":\"1 pending invite\",\"FamilyManagement_SelectJoinButtonPendingInvites\":\"%1$s pending invites\",\"FamilyManagement_UndeleteButton\":\"Restore Family\",\"FamilyManagement_CooldownAllowed\":\"Normally, your account would be prevented from joining or creating a Steam Family until %1$s.\",\"FamilyManagement_CooldownAllowed_2_Create\":\"As a customer service gesture we are waiving this restriction, and you are able to create a Steam Family at this time.\",\"FamilyManagement_CooldownAllowed_2_Join\":\"As a customer service gesture we are waiving this restriction, and you are able to join a Steam Family at this time.\",\"FamilyManagement_FamilyCreated\":\"Steam Family created\",\"FamilyManagement_FamilyJoined\":\"Steam Family joined\",\"FamilyManagement_Back\":\"Back\",\"FamilyManagement_CreateAFamilyHeader\":\"Create a family\",\"FamilyManagement_CreateAFamilyText\":\"Enter a name below to create a Family. This name is only visible to current and invited members, and can be changed at any time. Once your Steam Family is created, you will be able to invite household members to the family.\",\"FamilyManagement_InputNamePlaceholder\":\"Enter the family name\",\"FamilyManagement_FinalizeCreateFamily\":\"Create\",\"FamilyManagement_JoinAFamily\":\"Join a family\",\"FamilyManagement_PendingInvitesHeader\":\"Pending family invites\",\"FamilyManagement_PendingInvitesText\":\"You have been invited to join an existing family. <1>WARNING:</1> Do not join a Steam Family unless you know and trust the people involved. Steam Families are meant for close households; <2>once you accept an invite, you cannot join a different Steam Family for one year.</2>\",\"FamilyManagement_YourFriendCode\":\"Your friend code\",\"FamilyManagement_ToJoinInstructions\":\"To join an existing Steam Family, an adult member that you are friends with on Steam must invite you.\",\"FamilyManagement_OtherInvite\":\"You have 1 other invite.\",\"FamilyManagement_OtherInvites\":\"You have %1$s other invites.\",\"FamilyManagement_Expand\":\"Expand...\",\"FamilyManagement_Collapse\":\"Collapse...\",\"FamilyManagement_ConfirmJoinDialog\":\"Confirm join\",\"FamilyManagement_RoleDescriptionShort_Adult\":\"As an <1>Adult</1> member of a Steam Family, you can manage members and set parental controls for children. <2>Learn more</2>\",\"FamilyManagement_RoleDescriptionShort_Child\":\"As a <1>Child</1> your account is managed by adults in your Steam Family. <2>Learn more</2>\",\"FamilyManagement_RoleDescriptionShort_Child_1\":\"Adults can restrict your access to games and Steam features\",\"FamilyManagement_RoleDescriptionShort_Child_2\":\"Adults can reset your password\",\"FamilyManagement_RoleDescriptionShort_Child_3\":\"You cannot leave the family unless an Adult removes you\",\"FamilyManagement_RoleDescriptionLongHeader_1\":\"Adults in families\",\"FamilyManagement_RoleDescriptionLongHeader_2\":\"Children in families\",\"FamilyManagement_AdultDescription_1\":\"Adults in Steam families control who is in the family and what children in the family can do. Adults can invite new members, remove existing members, and leave the family themselves. They can play any game from the family library.\",\"FamilyManagement_AdultDescription_2\":\"Adults can control the following features of child accounts:\",\"FamilyManagement_AdultDescription_3\":\"Restrict the child\\'s access to the Steam store and community.\",\"FamilyManagement_AdultDescription_4\":\"Limit the games that a child can play.\",\"FamilyManagement_AdultDescription_5\":\"Limit the amount of time and when during the day a child can play.\",\"FamilyManagement_ChildDescription_1\":\"Children in families can play games from the family library, but are otherwise very limited in what they can do. They cannot leave the family unless an adult in the family removes them, they cannot invite new members, and they cannot see anything about the family except its current members. They are subject to controls from the adult members. In particular, adults in the family can:\",\"FamilyManagement_ChildDescription_2\":\"Restrict the child\\'s access to the Steam store and community.\",\"FamilyManagement_ChildDescription_3\":\"Limit the games that a child can play.\",\"FamilyManagement_ChildDescription_4\":\"Limit the amount of time and when during the day a child can play.\",\"FamilyManagement_ChildDescription_5\":\"Do not join a family as a child unless you are invited by a trusted parent or guardian.\",\"FamilyManagement_FamilyInfoHeader\":\"Overview\",\"FamilyManagement_MembersHeader\":\"Members\",\"FamilyManagement_DeleteFamilyHeader\":\"Delete Steam Family\",\"FamilyManagement_JoiningAFamilyHeader\":\"Join a Steam Family\",\"FamilyManagement_CreateFamilyName\":\"Family Name:\",\"FamilyManagement_HeaderLabel\":\"Your family\",\"FamilyManagement_MemberCount\":\"(%1$s of %2$s spots full)\",\"FamilyManagement_EditFamilyNameSaveButton\":\"Save\",\"FamilyManagement_EditFamilyNameCancelButton\":\"Cancel\",\"FamilyManagement_DeleteFamilyVerbiage\":\"Deleting your Steam Family will remove all members from the family and disable parental controls on all children in the family. After you delete this Steam Family you will not be able to create or join another Steam Family until %1$s.\",\"FamilyManagement_Copy\":\"Copy\",\"FamilyManagement_Copied\":\"Copied\",\"FamilyManagement_CannotJoinWhileAlreadyMember\":\"Oops! You tried to accept an invitation to a Steam Family, but this account is already a member of a family. Please log in to the account that received the invitation.\",\"FamilyManagement_Invite\":\"Invite\",\"FamilyManagement_ChooseRole\":\"Choose this member\\'s role in your family\",\"FamilyManagement_ConfirmInviteTitle\":\"Confirm invitation\",\"FamilyManagement_InviteAMember\":\"Invite a Member\",\"FamilyManagement_InviteCooldownWarning\":\"You cannot invite new members for %1$s more day(s). You can still re-invite former members in the meantime.\",\"FamilyManagement_InviteRoleDescription\":\"What type of member would you like to invite?\",\"FamilyManagement_InviteDescription_Adult\":\"Here are the considerations and expectations you should take into account by inviting an Adult to your family.\",\"FamilyManagement_InviteDescription_Child\":\"Here are the considerations and expectations you should take into account by inviting a Child to your family.\",\"FamilyManagement_SelectInviteMethod\":\"Select the invite method:\",\"FamilyManagement_InviteMethodFriend\":\"Search friend list\",\"FamilyManagement_InviteMethodFriendCode\":\"Enter Friend Code\",\"FamilyManagement_InviteMethodDeviceSharing\":\"Invite a user sharing this computer\",\"FamilyManagement_InviteMethodFormerMembers\":\"Invite a former member\",\"FamilyManagement_CooldownAndReinvite\":\"Your family cannot invite new members until %1$s. Until then you can reinvite the following former members:\",\"FamilyManagement_PreviousUsers\":\"Suggested friends:\",\"FamilyManagement_SelectFriend\":\"Search for a Steam user to invite from the list below.\",\"FamilyManagement_InviteFriendNamePlaceholder\":\"Search for a Steam user to invite\",\"FamilyManagement_InviteFriendCodeDescription\":\"Enter your family member\\'s Friend Code to invite them to the Steam family.\",\"FamilyManagement_FriendCodePlaceholder\":\"Enter a Friend Code\",\"FamilyManagement_InvalidFriendCode\":\"Friend code invalid. Please re-enter the friend code and try again.\",\"FamilyManagement_SetFriendCodeButton\":\"Search\",\"FamilyManagement_InviteButton\":\"Invite\",\"FamilyManagement_InviteAsRoleButton_1\":\"Invite as Adult\",\"FamilyManagement_InviteAsRoleButton_2\":\"Invite as Child\",\"FamilyManagement_InviteCancelButton\":\"Cancel\",\"FamilyManagement_OtherInvitationsHeader\":\"Other invitations\",\"FamilyManagement_InviteMethodText\":\"Who would you like to invite?\",\"FamilyManagement_DeleteFamilyConfirmationTitle\":\"Delete Family\",\"FamilyManagement_DeleteFamilyConfirmationText_NoCooldown\":\"This will completely delete this Steam Family. You can create or join another Steam Family immediately.\",\"FamilyManagement_DeleteFamilyConfirmationText_1\":\"This will completely delete this Steam family. In particular,\",\"FamilyManagement_DeleteFamilyConfirmationText_2\":\"You will not be able to create or join a new Steam family until %1$s.\",\"FamilyManagement_DeleteFamilyConfirmationText_3\":\"Any previous members of this family will no longer be able to rejoin it.\",\"FamilyManagement_DeleteFamilyConfirmationText_4\":\"All history and requests associated with this family will be deleted.\",\"FamilyManagement_DeleteFamilyButton\":\"Delete Family\",\"FamilyManagement_InvitePending\":\"Invite pending\",\"FamilyManagement_InvitePendingDescription\":\"Once they accept your invitation and you perform a final confirmation they will be a member of your Family.\",\"FamilyManagement_CancelInviteButton\":\"Cancel Invite\",\"FamilyManagement_ResendInviteButton\":\"Resend Invite\",\"FamilyManagement_PendingFamilyInviteInviteText_Adult\":\"%1$s has invited you to join their family as an %2$s\",\"FamilyManagement_PendingFamilyInviteInviteText_Child\":\"%1$s has invited you to join their family as a %2$s\",\"FamilyManagement_ConfirmJoin_1\":\"You are joining this Steam family as an <1>adult</1>. Do you wish to proceed?\",\"FamilyManagement_ConfirmJoin_2\":\"You are joining this Steam family as a <1>child</1>. Do you wish to proceed?\",\"FamilyManagement_LearnMore\":\"Learn more\",\"FamilyManagement_Close\":\"Close\",\"FamilyManagement_ConfirmInvite\":\"Confirm that you want to invite this user to your Steam Family.\",\"FamilyManagement_Await2FAForInvite_Title\":\"\",\"FamilyManagement_Await2FAForInvite_EmailAuth\":\"A confirmation request has been sent to your email. Click on the link in the email message to send this invitation.\",\"FamilyManagement_Await2FAForInvite_MobileAuth\":\"A confirmation request has been sent to your Steam Mobile app. Confirm the request on your mobile device to send this invitation.\",\"FamilyManagement_Await2FAForInvite_MobileAuth_InMobileApp\":\"A confirmation request has been sent. Please approve it in the Confirmations tab.\",\"FamilyManagement_Await2FAForJoin_Header\":\"Confirm join\",\"FamilyManagement_Await2FAForJoin_Description_Mobile_MobileApp\":\"A confirmation request has been sent. Please approve it in the Confirmations tab.\",\"FamilyManagement_Await2FAForJoin_Description_Mobile\":\"A confirmation request has been sent to your Steam mobile app. Please accept the confirmation there to join this family.\",\"FamilyManagement_Await2FAForJoin_Description_Email\":\"A confirmation code has been emailed to you. Please paste the code below and click Confirm to join the family.\",\"FamilyManagement_Await2FAForJoin_ChildWarning_1\":\"Once you enter your confirmation code, you will be joining this Steam Family as a Child, giving any Adult in the Steam Family FULL CONTROL over your account.\",\"FamilyManagement_Await2FAForJoin_ChildWarning_2\":\"No Steam support agent or Valve employee will ever ask you to do this. If this invite did not come from your parent or guardian, it is likely a scam and you should <1>reset your password</1>.\",\"FamilyManagement_Await2FAForJoin_InputPlaceholder\":\"Confirmation code\",\"FamilyManagement_AwaitCodeFromEmail_Confirm\":\"Confirm\",\"FamilyManagement_AwaitCodeFromEmail_Cancel\":\"Cancel\",\"FamilyManagement_AlreadyAccepted_Header\":\"Confirm join\",\"FamilyManagement_AlreadyAccepted_Text\":\"A confirmation request has been sent. Please approve it to join this family.\",\"FamilyManagement_FamilyOverviewHeader\":\"Family members:\",\"FamilyManagement_AcceptInviteButton\":\"Accept\",\"FamilyManagement_DeclineInviteButton\":\"Decline\",\"FamilyManagement_IncomingInviteGone\":\"Oops, we couldn\\'t find that invitation. Are you logged in to the right account?\",\"FamilyManagement_Role_0\":\"Unknown\",\"FamilyManagement_Role_1\":\"Adult\",\"FamilyManagement_Role_2\":\"Child\",\"FamilyManagement_RemoveMemberConfirmationTitle\":\"Remove From Family\",\"FamilyManagement_RemoveMemberConfirmationText\":\"Are you sure you want to remove %1$s from your Steam Family?\\\\n\\\\nOnce removed, their games will no longer be available to your Steam Family and they will no longer be able to borrow games from your Family\\'s collection.\",\"FamilyManagement_CannotJoinFor\":\"They will not be able to join another Steam Family for %1$s days.\",\"FamilyManagement_CannotJoinFor_Plural\":\"They will not be able to join another Steam Family for %1$s day.\",\"FamilyManagement_RemoveMemberConfirmationTitle_Self\":\"Leave Family\",\"FamilyManagement_RemoveMemberConfirmationText_Self\":\"Are you sure you want to leave the family?\\\\n\\\\nOnce removed, your games will no longer be available to this Steam Family and you will no longer be able to borrow games from this Family\\'s collection.\",\"FamilyManagement_CannotJoinFor_Self\":\"You will not be able to join another Steam Family for %1$s day.\",\"FamilyManagement_CannotJoinFor_Self_Plural\":\"You will not be able to join another Steam Family for %1$s days.\",\"FamilyManagement_CannotJoinUntil\":\"Can join another Steam Family on\",\"FamilyManagement_RemoveMember\":\"Remove From Family\",\"FamilyManagement_RecoverMember\":\"Recover Account\",\"FamilyManagement_RemoveMember_Self\":\"Leave Family\",\"FamilyManagement_SuspendMember\":\"Suspend Member\",\"FamilyManagement_MemberSince\":\"Family member since %1$s\",\"FamilyManagement_ProfileLink\":\"Profile\",\"FamilyManagement_WishlistLink\":\"Wishlist\",\"FamilyManagement_ParentalControls\":\"Parental Controls\",\"FamilyManagement_ManageDialogTitle\":\"Manage %1$s\",\"FamilyManagement_Cancel\":\"Cancel\",\"FamilyManagement_CancelInvitationConfirmationTitle\":\"Cancel Invitation\",\"FamilyManagement_CancelInvitationConfirmationText\":\"Are you sure you want to withdraw your Steam Family invitation to %1$s?\",\"FamilyManagement_InviteeAlreadyMember\":\"Friend code %1$s is already a member of the family.\",\"FamilyManagement_InviteeAlreadyInvited\":\"Friend code %1$s already has a pending invitation to the family.\",\"FamilyManagement_ErrorCanOnlyInviteFriends\":\"You must be Steam friends with this user to invite them to the family.\",\"FamilyManagement_NoCurrentRequests\":\"Your family has no current requests. Purchase and access requests from children will appear here.\",\"PurchaseRequestBanner_PendingRequest\":\"%1$s pending purchase request\",\"PurchaseRequestBanner_PendingRequest_Plural\":\"%1$s pending purchase requests\",\"PurchaseRequestBanner_YouHavePendingRequestsForFamilyName\":\"You have %1$s for \\'%2$s\\'.\",\"PurchaseRequested_Header\":\"Your request has been sent.\",\"PurchaseRequested_Info\":\"The adults in your Steam Family will be notified via email and Steam notification. We\\'ll let you know when they act on your request.\",\"PurchaseRequested_ReturnToStore\":\"Return to the Store\",\"PurchaseRequested_ViewRequests\":\"View your requests\",\"PurchaseRequest_RequestCompletedHeader\":\"This request is no longer active.\",\"PurchaseRequest_RequestNotFoundHeader\":\"This request could not be found.\",\"PurchaseRequest_RequestPendingHeader\":\"This request is still pending\",\"PurchaseRequest_RequestPendingInfo\":\"Please wait for an adult in your Steam Family to respond to this purchase request.\",\"PurchaseRequest_RequestErrorHeader\":\"Error loading the request.\",\"Cart_LicenseContextTitle\":\"A purchase of a digital product grants a license for the product on Steam.\",\"Cart_LicenseContextLink\":\"For full terms and conditions, please see the %1$s\",\"Cart_LicenseContextSSA\":\"Steam Subscriber Agreement\",\"Parental_EnableDropdown\":\"Parental controls for this user\",\"FeatureRequest_UserRequested\":\"%2$s has requested:\",\"FeatureRequest_UserRequested_Self\":\"You requested:\",\"PlaytimeRequest_UserRequested\":\"%2$s has requested additional playtime\",\"PlaytimeRequest_UserRequested_Self\":\"You requested additional playtime\",\"ParentalRequest_Accept\":\"Approve\",\"ParentalRequest_Reject\":\"Decline\",\"ParentalRequest_Pending\":\"Pending\",\"ParentalRequest_AcceptedBy\":\"Approved by:\",\"ParentalRequest_RejectedBy\":\"Declined by:\",\"ParentalRequest_Canceled\":\"Canceled:\",\"FeatureRequest_AcceptDialog_Title\":\"Approve this request\",\"FeatureRequest_AcceptDialog_BodyText\":\"You can choose to temporarily grant access to the content or grant it permanently.\",\"FeatureRequest_AcceptDialog_AllowAccess\":\"Allow Access\",\"FeatureRequest_AcceptDialog_1Hour\":\"For 1 Hour\",\"FeatureRequest_AcceptDialog_4Hours\":\"For 4 Hours\",\"FeatureRequest_AcceptDialog_24Hours\":\"For 24 Hours\",\"FeatureRequest_AcceptDialog_Permanently\":\"Permanently\",\"PlaytimeRequest_AcceptDialog_BodyText\":\"You can grant this user additional playtime for the day and/or change the hours in which they can play.\",\"PlaytimeRequest_AcceptDialog_BodyText_UnlimitedWindows\":\"You can grant this user additional playtime for today.\",\"PlaytimeRequest_AcceptDialog_BodyText_UnlimitedHours\":\"You can change the hours today in which this user can play.\",\"PlaytimeRequest_AcceptDialog_CurrentHours\":\"This user is currently limited to %1$s hour of playtime today.\",\"PlaytimeRequest_AcceptDialog_CurrentHours_Plural\":\"This user is currently limited to %1$s hours of playtime today.\",\"PlaytimeRequest_AcceptDialog_UnlimitedHours\":\"This user has no limit on playtime for today.\",\"PlaytimeRequest_AcceptDialog_AdditionalTime\":\"Grant Additional Playtime\",\"PurchaseRequest_UserRequested\":\"%2$s has requested the purchase of the following item:\",\"PurchaseRequest_UserRequested_Plural\":\"%2$s has requested the purchase of the following items:\",\"PurchaseRequest_UserRequested_Self\":\"You requested the purchase of the following item:\",\"PurchaseRequest_UserRequested_Self_Plural\":\"You requested the purchase of the following items:\",\"PurchaseRequest_Purchased\":\"Purchased item:\",\"PurchaseRequest_Purchased_Plural\":\"Purchased items:\",\"PurchaseRequest_PackageLinksSeparator\":\", \",\"PurchaseRequest_PackageLinksFinalSeparator\":\" and \",\"PurchaseRequest_PackageLinksShowMore\":\"%1$s more...\",\"PurchaseRequest_Approve\":\"Approve\",\"PurchaseRequest_Decline\":\"Decline\",\"PurchaseRequest_Cancel\":\"Cancel\",\"PurchaseRequest_PurchasedBy\":\"Purchased by:\",\"PurchaseRequest_DeclinedBy\":\"Declined by:\",\"PurchaseRequest_CanceledBy\":\"Canceled by:\",\"PurchaseRequest_Abandoned\":\"Abandoned\",\"Parental_Settings_PageError\":\"An error occurred while loading your family member\\'s settings. Please try again later.\",\"Parental_Settings_Return\":\"< Return to Family Settings\",\"Parental_Settings_For\":\"Parental Settings for\",\"Parental_Tab_AllowedGames\":\"Allowed Games\",\"Parental_Tab_Settings\":\"Settings\",\"Parental_Tab_PlaytimeLimits\":\"Playtime Limits\",\"Parental_Feature_1\":\"Allow access to the Steam store\",\"Parental_Feature_2\":\"Allow access to community generated content\",\"Parental_Feature_3\":\"Allow access to their online profile, screenshots, and achievements\",\"Parental_Feature_4\":\"Allow access to friends, chat, and groups\",\"Parental_Feature_5\":\"Allow access to Steam and game news\",\"Parental_Feature_6\":\"Allow access to Steam trading\",\"Parental_Feature_7\":\"Allow access to Steam settings\",\"Parental_Feature_8\":\"Allow access to the Steam command console\",\"Parental_Feature_9\":\"Allow unfiltered access to the Steam web browser\",\"Parental_Feature_Store\":\"Allow access to the Steam store\",\"Parental_Feature_Community\":\"Allow 