ontentHubby_Hub_trains\":\"Trains\",\"ContentHubby_Hub_trains_desc\":\"Lay tracks, plan routes, or just control your locomotive through cities and countryside\",\"ContentHubby_Hub_cyberpunk\":\"Cyberpunk\",\"ContentHubby_Hub_cyberpunk_desc\":\"All kinds of high tech, set in a dystopian sci-fi future\",\"ContentHubby_Hub_pinsandpegs\":\"Pins and Pegs\",\"ContentHubby_Hub_pinsandpegs_desc\":\"Launching balls to bounce off pegs and knock down pins\",\"ContentHubby_Hub_pvesurvival\":\"PvE Survival Crafting\",\"ContentHubby_Hub_pvesurvival_desc\":\"Collect and craft to ensure your survival against the elements\",\"ContentHubby_Hub_programming\":\"Programming\",\"ContentHubby_Hub_programming_desc\":\"Write instructions, hacking, and solving complex logic puzzles\",\"ContentHubby_Hub_partyrpg\":\"Party-Based RPG\",\"ContentHubby_Hub_partyrpg_desc\":\"Acquire gear and level up with your own crew\",\"ContentHubby_Hub_auto_battler_rpg\":\"Auto-Battler RPG\",\"ContentHubby_Hub_auto_battler_rpg_desc\":\"Automatic combat following a pre-defined or random sequence\",\"ContentHubby_Hub_desktop_companion\":\"Desktop Companion\",\"ContentHubby_Hub_desktop_companion_desc\":\"Keeping you company while you do other things\",\"ContentHubby_Hub_shop_keeper\":\"Shop Keeper\",\"ContentHubby_Hub_shop_keeper_desc\":\"Run your own store and pursue profit or customer happiness. Can you do both?\",\"ContentHubby_Hub_sheep\":\"Sheep\",\"ContentHubby_Hub_sheep_desc\":\"Sheep and/or goats\",\"ContentHubby_Hub_couch_coop\":\"Couch Co-Op\",\"ContentHubby_Hub_couch_coop_desc\":\"Bring your friends, sit back, and play together\",\"ContentHubby_Hub_witch\":\"Witch\",\"ContentHubby_Hub_witch_desc\":\"Prominently featuring witches\",\"ContentHubby_Hub_mountaineering\":\"Mountaineering\",\"ContentHubby_Hub_mountaineering_desc\":\"Walking, hiking, snow-shoeing, or rock climbing\",\"ContentHubby_Hub_fantasy_and_supernatural\":\"Fantasy & Supernatural\",\"ContentHubby_Hub_shooters_without_zombies\":\"Shooters Sans Zombies\",\"ContentHubby_Hub_relaxing_animal_puzzles\":\"Relaxing Animal Puzzles\",\"ContentHubby_Menu_NewAndNoteworthy\":\"New & Noteworthy\",\"ContentHubby_Menu_CurrentSpecials\":\"Discounts & Events\",\"ContentHubby_Hub_adjustable_difficulty\":\"Adjustable Difficulty\",\"ContentHubby_Hub_adjustable_difficulty_desc\":\"These games provide multiple ways to adjust the level difficulty.\",\"ContentHubby_Hub_save_anytime\":\"Save Anytime\",\"ContentHubby_Hub_save_anytime_desc\":\"These games allow you to manually save progress at almost any time.\",\"ContentHubby_Hub_adjustable_text_size\":\"Adjustable Text Size\",\"ContentHubby_Hub_adjustable_text_size_desc\":\"You can adjust text size and UI scaling in these games to make words and elements appear larger or smaller.\",\"ContentHubby_Hub_subtitle_options\":\"Subtitle Options\",\"ContentHubby_Hub_subtitle_options_desc\":\"You can adjust the way subtitles are displayed, such as font size, color, and background opacity.\",\"ContentHubby_Hub_color_alternatives\":\"Color Alternatives\",\"ContentHubby_Hub_color_alternatives_desc\":\"Gameplay doesn\\'t rely on colors to communicate important information, or you can change the colors used.\",\"ContentHubby_Hub_camera_comfort\":\"Camera Comfort\",\"ContentHubby_Hub_camera_comfort_desc\":\"These games allow you to adjust or disable uncomfortable camera movement (such as screen shaking, camera bob, or motion blur), or doesn\\'t feature these effects.\",\"ContentHubby_Hub_custom_volume_controls\":\"Custom Volume Controls\",\"ContentHubby_Hub_custom_volume_controls_desc\":\"These games allow you to independently adjust the volume for different types of in-game audio (such as music, sound effects, or voices).\",\"ContentHubby_Hub_stereo_sound\":\"Stereo Sound\",\"ContentHubby_Hub_stereo_sound_desc\":\"These games allow you to use stereo audio to tell how far to the left or right sounds are coming from.\",\"ContentHubby_Hub_surround_sound\":\"Surround Sound\",\"ContentHubby_Hub_surround_sound_desc\":\"These games allow you to use surround sound to identify how far in any direction sounds are coming from.\",\"ContentHubby_Hub_narrated_game_menus\":\"Narrated Game Menus\",\"ContentHubby_Hub_narrated_game_menus_desc\":\"These games support screen readers or offers menu narration, so that menus can be used and understood without seeing the text.\",\"ContentHubby_Hub_playable_without_timed_input\":\"Playable Without Quick Time Events\",\"ContentHubby_Hub_playable_without_timed_input_desc\":\"These games allow you to avoid sequences of precisely timed inputs (\\'quick time events\\') or button mashing.\",\"ContentHubby_Hub_keyboard_only_option\":\"Keyboard-only Option\",\"ContentHubby_Hub_keyboard_only_option_desc\":\"These games can be played with just a keyboard, or an accessibility tool that maps to keyboard inputs.\",\"ContentHubby_Hub_mouse_only_option\":\"Mouse-only Option\",\"ContentHubby_Hub_mouse_only_option_desc\":\"These games can be played with just a mouse or an accessibility tool that maps to mouse inputs.\",\"ContentHubby_Hub_touch_only_option\":\"Touch-only Option\",\"ContentHubby_Hub_touch_only_option_desc\":\"These games can be played with just touch controls or an accessibility tool that maps to touch inputs.\",\"ContentHubby_Hub_chat_speech_to_text\":\"Chat Speech-to-text\",\"ContentHubby_Hub_chat_speech_to_text_desc\":\"These games allow voice chat to be read as a text transcript in real time.\",\"ContentHubby_Hub_chat_text_to_speech\":\"Chat Text-to-speech\",\"ContentHubby_Hub_chat_text_to_speech_desc\":\"These games allow text chat to be narrated out loud in real time.\",\"ContentHubby_Hub_playable_at_your_own_pace\":\"Playable at Your Own Pace\",\"ContentHubby_Hub_playable_at_your_own_pace_desc\":\"These games allow you to take your time between every input.\",\"ContentHubby_Hub_playable_without_vision\":\"Playable Without Vision\",\"ContentHubby_Hub_playable_without_vision_desc\":\"These games can be played without seeing the screen.\",\"ContentHubby_Hub_contrast_controls\":\"Contrast Controls\",\"ContentHubby_Hub_contrast_controls_desc\":\"These games allow adjusting contrast for your comfort.\",\"browse_adultonly\":\"Adult Only\",\"browse_demos\":\"Demos\",\"genre_free2play\":\"Free to Play\",\"genre_early_access\":\"Early Access\",\"store_tab_greatondeck\":\"Great On Deck\",\"store_tab_greatonframe\":\"Great On Frame\",\"contenthub_title_controller\":\"Controller Friendly\",\"browse_remoteplay\":\"Remote Play\",\"Store_VR_MainMenu_Virtual_Reality\":\"VR Titles\",\"Store_VR_MainMenu_VR_Hardware\":\"VR Hardware\",\"store_tab_software_home\":\"Software\",\"additional_game_content_soundtracks\":\"Soundtracks\",\"games_osx\":\"macOS\",\"store_tab_linux\":\"SteamOS + Linux\",\"contenthub_title_pccafe\":\"For PC Cafés\",\"msg_try_it_now\":\"Try it now\",\"Library_Update_TryItNow2\":\"Try it now\",\"dummy\":\"dummy\"}')}}]);"
